## Diagrams

A `<diagram>` tag draws a diagram with the slide's colors; press **t** to see it follow the theme.

<diagram width=100%>
  flowchart LR
    md[.slide] --> parse[Parse] --> diff{{GumTree diff}} --> play[Animate]
    diff -. same language .-> play
    parse --> pdf[PDF / static / exe]
</diagram>

<notes>
  Mermaid is loaded when a slide first needs it and left out of builds whose decks never use it.
</notes>
